# Permissions

- Roles: {{owner · editor · viewer · admin}} (`docs/DATABASE.md` §3 access matrix is the source).
- Server/RLS decides; UI hides what a role can't do with `{{<Can permission=…>}}` / `{{usePermissions()}}` only as a convenience.
- Every new table: RLS on in the same migration + a test that user A can't read user B's rows.

## Never
- Permission checks only in the UI
- service-role key in client code
- tables without RLS
